# Gitignore Update Chore

This commit updates .gitignore for full-stack project development:
- Ignore backend/logs/ (development logs, not source control)
- Ignore .env files (secrets and credentials)
- Ignore node_modules/ (dependencies, can be reinstalled)
- Ignore IDE settings (.vscode/, .idea/)
- Ignore build outputs (dist/, build/)
- Ignore OS-specific files (.DS_Store, Thumbs.db)

This ensures no secrets, dependencies, or temporary files 
are accidentally committed to version control.

Updated files:
- .gitignore (comprehensive rules at root)
